# RunicAI RLM Summarizer

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:runic_ai, path: ".."}
])
```

RLM-style workflows keep large sources outside one expanding prompt and run
bounded model work over slices.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  source[External source] --> split[Split]
  split --> materialize[Materialize slices]
  materialize --> map[Map leaves]
  map --> reduce[Reduce summaries]
  reduce --> artifact[Materialized artifact]
```

Use `RunicAI.Recipes.RLMSummarizer` when a direct prompt would be too large or
too opaque to inspect.
